{"id":"e662d8dd61767d1d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_L3PartialVal.md","title":"L3PartialVal","display":"L3PartialVal","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"L3PartialVal","parameters":["v"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"L3PartialVal"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>v</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：三值语义与有限表证书。有序参数：<code>v</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ L3PartialVal v)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Fun v)\n  (forall x\n    (forall y (implies (@ App v x y) (and (@ Nat x) (exists three (and (@ Num3 three) (in y three))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eff666f032881d1b\" href=\"?note=eff666f032881d1b\" title=\"ZFC_Fun\">Fun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"328ced6f64afa4d9\" href=\"?note=328ced6f64afa4d9\" title=\"ZFC_Num3\">Num3</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖"